        <div class="fc-delta-reason">Requires Yashar wins plurality Oct 27 (~64% per Polymarket, ~60% per most polls) AND President tasks Eisenkot within ~19 days of certified results (standard practice). Coalition arithmetic is unclear — neither bloc holds 61 seats in any poll — meaning delay or surprise consultation is possible. P=0.35 reflects conditional probability: (Yashar wins ~0.64) × (presidential tasking within window ~0.55), discounted for gridlock risk.</div>
        <dl class="fc-meta-row">
